        "created_at": "2012-08-24T01:41:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The dashes and apostrophes are now returned to their normal state, and the documents are again readable.&nbsp; It looks like the updated forums frowned upon my use of quotation marks and eliminated everything after that for Tachyon and Legacy.&nbsp; Restored.</p><p>I took the liberty of&nbsp;further editing my phrasing, and updated&nbsp;the guides to be compatible with Enhanced Edition.&nbsp; Give them another read, I've added content.</p><p>I now have outstanding requests for Absolute Zero and Expatriette.&nbsp; I write these things in the order they come to me, but I will make an effort to get those heroes published in particular.</p>",
